  "synonym_discrimination": {
    "words": [
      "security-n",
      "safety-n"
    ],
    "note": "**Safety** is protection from accidents and harm in general (*road safety*, *safety at work*). **Security** is mainly protection from people who might do harm on purpose, such as thieves or attackers (*airport security*), and the protection of a country or of information (*national security*, *data security*); it is also the feeling of being safe about the future (*job security*)."
  },
